      "message": "Log.wtf in bootclasspath (app process) code may crash the app, see `android.util.Log.TerribleFailureHandler`, `RuntimeInit.wtf` and `ActivityManagerService#handleApplicationWtf`. It has different behavior for system server and system apps where it doesn\u0027t crash.\n\nSo if you want to avoid crashing in this case I think it can at most be Log.e. For a Log.wtf you\u0027d need to send the information to system_server (ConnectivityService ?) and do it from there.",
